Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.34,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,いつまでも
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.01,0:19:33.21,OP日,,0,0,0,fx,{\an7\fnSTBQGPD0\fs55\pos(10,20)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1\blur4\3a&H50&\fad(300,300)}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.01,0:19:33.21,OP日,,0,0,0,fx,{\an7\fnSTBQGPD0\fs55\pos(10,20)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1\blur4\3a&H50&\fad(300,300)\alpha&HFF&}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:32.53,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,うじうじして
